SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] School Health-Related Services: Recommended D
 raft Rates\, Presented Materials\, and Comment Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			School Health-Related Services: Recommended Draft Rates
 \, Presented Materials\, and Comment Deadline\nSchool Health-Related Servi
 ces: Recommended Draft Rates\, Presented Materials\, and Comment Deadline\
 nOct 09\, 2026\nOn\nOctober 9\, 2026\n\, MaineCare held an online public m
 eeting to present recommended\ndraft rates and assumptions\nalong with\nde
 tailed rate exhibits\nfor school health-related services. The\nPowerPoint 
 presentation\nand\nvideo recording\nof the meeting are available on our Ma
 ineCare\nRate System Reform webpage\n.\nAs providers and other interested 
 parties\, your feedback is important. We encourage your participation.\nTh
 e Department will accept written comments on these recommendations through
  the deadline of October 23\, 2026\n.\nPlease submit comments directly\nto
  our vendor\nMilliman Inc\n.\nThe Department will summarize all comments a
 nd include an explanation of whether and how we incorporated the feedback 
 into the final rate determination.\nPlease contact\nJessica Levesque\n\, M
 aineCare’s\nproject lead\,\nwith questions related to this rate determin
 ation process.\nThis notice is sent pursuant to\nRate Reform law\n.\nhttps
 ://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/school-health-relat
 ed-services-recommended-draft-rates-presented-materials-and-comment
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/school-hea
 lth-related-services-recommended-draft-rates-presented-materials-and-comme
 nt
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
