SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] Attention Trading Partners: Refresher Trainin
 g for New MaineCare Partner Portal
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			Attention Trading Partners: Refresher Training for New 
 MaineCare Partner Portal\nAttention Trading Partners: Refresher Training f
 or New MaineCare Partner Portal\nOct 05\, 2026\nAs a reminder\, the new Ma
 ineCare Partner Portal is scheduled to go live on\nOctober 12\, 2026\, at 
 8:00 AM\n. The new portal will replace the current HealthPAS Online Portal
  and provide enhanced functionality to support Trading Partner operations.
  We are adding additional live\, virtual instructor-led training sessions 
 to help Trading Partners prepare for the transition.\nAs a reminder\, reco
 rded training sessions\, training materials\, user guides\, Q&A documents 
 from training sessions\, and supporting resources are available through th
 e\nMMIS Learning Center\nand will continue to be available after go-live.\
 nPlease share this training information with staff responsible for claims\
 , authorizations\, referrals\, account maintenance\, and portal administra
 tion activities. Staff should not wait for refresher training to become fa
 miliar with the materials.\nKey Reminders\nTrading Partner Administrator (
 R7) accounts will be migrated to the new portal.\nAdditional users will be
  invited and managed by Trading Partner Administrators after go-live.\nTra
 ding Partner Administrators (R7 users) should prepare for portal access an
 d account setup activities by reviewing the training materials available i
 n the MMIS Learning Center before go-live.\nMaineCare Partner Portal Refre
 sher Training Sessions\nParticipants may register for any session that ali
 gns with their role and responsibilities. Please see\nthis e-message\nfor 
 a description of each course.\nTraining\nDates & Times (ET)\nME - TPT Refr
 esher - Migrated Trading Partner Log In and Account Maintenance Training (
 ILC)\n- this course is only for Admin (R7) users\nMonday\, October 5\, 9:0
 0 – 10:30\nWednesday\, October 7\, 11:00 AM – 12:30 PM\nME - TPT Refre
 sher - \nhttps://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/atten
 tion-trading-partners-refresher-training-new-mainecare-partner-portal-2026
 -10-05
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/attention-
 trading-partners-refresher-training-new-mainecare-partner-portal-2026-10-0
 5
