SUMMARY:[Curated Role Feeds] To Providers of Adult or Children's Services 
 to Individuals with Intellectual Disabilities (ID) or Autism
DESCRIPTION:Maine.gov\nAgencies\n|\nOnline Services\n|\nHelp\n|\nSearch Ma
 ine.gov\nDHHS\n→\nOffice of MaineCare Services (OMS)\n→\nProvider Reso
 urces\n→\n	 \n			To Providers of Adult or Children's Services to Individ
 uals with Intellectual Disabilities (ID) or Autism\nTo Providers of Adult 
 or Children's Services to Individuals with Intellectual Disabilities (ID) 
 or Autism\nOct 02\, 2026\nThe State of Maine Department of Health and Huma
 n Services (DHHS) Office of Aging and Disability Services (OADS) is planni
 ng to launch the new Lifespan Waiver in May 2027.\nOur first priority is t
 o offer support for future providers of Lifespan services.  Following ou
 r Lifespan Provider Readiness project in 2025\, we are reaching out to und
 erstand provider interest in offering services under Lifespan. To that end
 \, we created a survey to gauge interest from providers who serve individu
 als\nfourteen or older\nwho have ID or autism.\nPlease take a few minutes 
 to\ncomplete this survey\n.\nThe survey will be open until\nFriday\, Octob
 er 16\, at 4:00 PM\n.\nFilling out the survey does not obligate an agency 
 to provide services. We are both gauging interest in particular services\,
  but also gathering contact information so we can provide technical assist
 ance to agencies. For example\, we hope to sustain Communities of Practice
 \, and provide training opportunities.\nFor questions\, please contact the
 \nOADS Lifespan Project\n.\nThank you for your interest\, and we look forw
 ard to being in contact regarding Lifespan.\n~ The OADS Team\nNot yet subs
 cribed to OADS’ email communications?\nClick to subscribe\n.\nhttps://ww
 w.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/providers-adult-or-child
 rens-services-individuals-intellectual-disabilities-id-or-autism
URL:https://www.maine.gov/dhhs/oms/providers/provider-bulletins/providers-
 adult-or-childrens-services-individuals-intellectual-disabilities-id-or-au
 tism
CATEGORIES:Curated Role Feeds
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
